        "name": "USN-6933-1",
        "description": "It was discovered that ClickHouse incorrectly handled memory, leading to a heap out-of-bounds data read. An attacker could possibly use this issue to cause a denial of service, or leak sensitive information. (CVE-2021-42387, CVE-2021-41388)  It was discovered that ClickHouse incorrectly handled memory, leading to a heap-based buffer overflow. An attacker could possibly use this issue to cause a denial of service, or execute arbitrary code. (CVE-2021-43305)",
        "aliases": [
          "CVE-2021-42387",
          "CVE-2021-42388",
          "CVE-2021-43305"
        ]
      },
